@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Liveness: expect 200 and {"status":"ok","time":"...Z"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: expect 200 and {"status":"ok","checks":{"database":"ok","redis":"ok"}}
# Stop Redis (docker compose stop redis) and send it again: expect 503 and "redis":"fail".
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Unknown route: expect 404 and {"error":{"code":"NOT_FOUND",...}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
